Package: roadcrashVIC
Title: Explore Victorian Road Crashes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Eduardo", "Vitale", , "eduardo.vitale@studio.unibo.it", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides cleaned Victorian road crash data (casualty crashes, 2012 to 2025), local government
    area boundaries and resident population, with functions to filter crashes by date, summarise them by any variable
    and calculate rates per 100,000 residents. Includes a Shiny app for exploring how road trauma has changed
    across Victoria, and when and where crashes happen.
